# ── JavaScript reference implementation ──────────────────────────────────────
# Not part of this branch. The Rust port was written against the JS CLI, and the
# tree stayed in the porting sessions' working copies as the parity oracle; a
# clone of this branch is Rust-only.
#
# The artefacts it generated ARE tracked, because the Rust build needs them:
#   src/profiles.json — the 31 jurisdiction profiles
#   src/help.json     — the CLI help text
# Regenerate either in a tree that still has the JS:
#   node scripts/gen-profiles.mjs && node scripts/help-tree.mjs
*.js
*.mjs
*.cjs
package.json
package-lock.json
scripts/screenshot-template.html

# the cross-version fixture is a real book, committed deliberately
!tests/fixtures/*.db
